# platform-security — ABAC overlay (E3.4)

Cross-cutting library that owns the ABAC overlay evaluated on
every privileged mutation in the Java services. The overlay
sits on top of the OpenFGA relationship check (E3.3); the
two are non-overlapping per `design.md` §6.2.

| Primary | Secondary | On-call |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `@genealogy/platform` | `@genealogy/security` | `platform-oncall` |

See `README.md` and `runbook/abac.md` for the contract and
operational guide.
